msgid "Trigger immediate notifications (< 2s) via system events for WAN IP changes, Web/SSH logins, and new DHCP devices, instead of waiting for the polling interval."
msgstr "通过系统事件在 2 秒内即时触发 WAN IP 变动、Web/SSH 登录及新设备上线通知，无需等待轮询间隔。"

msgid "Online Notification Filter"
