msgid "Unknown (Brand-New) Devices Only"
msgstr "仅全新未知设备（首次上线）"

msgid "Whitelist Filter (Ignore Listed MACs)"
msgstr "白名单过滤（忽略列表内设备）"

msgid "Blacklist Filter (Notify Only Listed MACs)"
msgstr "黑名单过滤（仅通知列表内设备）"

msgid "Prevent frequent reconnect spam. In \"Unknown Devices Only\" mode, each new MAC is notified once on first sight, Whitelist MACs are ignored, and Blacklist MACs always notify."
msgstr "防止设备频繁重连刷屏。「仅全新未知设备」模式下每个新 MAC 仅首次上线推送一次；白名单内设备永久忽略；黑名单内设备每次上线都会强制推送。"

msgid "Device Whitelist (Ignore)"
msgstr "设备白名单（忽略）"

msgid "Trusted devices in this list will never trigger online notifications."
msgstr "列表内的受信任设备上线时不会触发通知。"

msgid "Device Blacklist (Watch)"
msgstr "设备黑名单（重点关注）"

msgid "Devices in this list will always trigger online notifications when connecting."
msgstr "列表内的设备每次接入上线时都会强制触发通知。"

msgid "Instant Push"
msgstr "即时推送"

msgid "Instant Push listens to system events (hotplug.d, logread, DHCP) to deliver notifications within 2 seconds without waiting for the polling cycle."
msgstr "即时推送通过监听系统事件（hotplug.d、logread、DHCP），在 2 秒内即时送达通知，无需等待轮询周期。"

