msgid "Unknown / First-Seen Devices Only"
msgstr "仅全新未知设备（首次上线）"

msgid "Blacklist (Watchlist) Devices Only"
msgstr "仅黑名单（重点关注）设备"

msgid "Combine freely with Whitelist (always ignore) and Blacklist (always notify) below. In \"Unknown / First-Seen\" mode, each new MAC is recorded in Known Devices and notified only once."
msgstr "可与下方「白名单（永久忽略）」和「黑名单（每次强制通知）」自由组合。在「仅全新未知设备」模式下，每个新 MAC 会记入已知设备记录并仅首次通知一次。"

msgid "Devices in this list will always trigger online notifications when connecting (overrides Whitelist/Known Devices)."
msgstr "列表内的设备每次接入上线都会强制触发通知（优先级高于白名单与已知记录）。"

msgid "Known Devices Record"
msgstr "已知设备记录"

msgid "MAC addresses already seen by \"Unknown / First-Seen\" mode (one per line). Remove a MAC to re-trigger its first-seen alert, or clear all to reset."
msgstr "「仅全新未知设备」模式已记录的 MAC 地址（每行一个）。删除某条可让该设备下次重新触发新设备提醒，清空即可重置。"

msgid "1. Device Blacklist (Always Notify)"
msgstr "1. 设备黑名单（优先强制通知）"

msgid "Highest priority: devices in this list always trigger online notifications regardless of the mode below."
msgstr "最高优先级：列表内设备每次上线都会强制触发通知，不受下方策略限制。"

msgid "2. Device Whitelist (Always Ignore)"
msgstr "2. 设备白名单（永久忽略）"

msgid "Second priority: trusted devices in this list never trigger online notifications."
msgstr "第二优先级：未命中黑名单时，列表内的受信任设备永不触发通知。"

msgid "3. Other Devices Policy"
msgstr "3. 其余设备策略"

